The model is NOT part of holoscan-sam3. tools/prepare_model.py (installed as
share/holoscan-sam3/prepare_model.py) downloads a pinned checkpoint from Hugging Face
with the user's own access token, checks every file's SHA-256 digest, and exports it
with a separately installed PyTorch and Hugging Face Transformers:

- SAM 3: facebook/sam3, revision 3c879f39826c281e95690f02c7821c4de09afae7
  (https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3). Meta's Segment Anything Model 3, its image
  and text encoders, detector and mask decoder.
